<section className="faqs bg-aurora">
        <div className="aurora-blob aurora-blob-1"></div>
        <div className="aurora-blob aurora-blob-2"></div>
        <div className="aurora-blob aurora-blob-3"></div>
        <h2>Cyber Security Course <span className="cc-highlight">FAQs</span></h2>
        <p className="faqDetails">Short answers to common questions about the course, security careers and what you practise during training.</p>
        <div className="faq-grid">
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>What is the Expert cyber security course?</summary>
                    <p>It is our 12-month, 288-hour programme that covers cyber security and ethical hacking from basics to expert level, including VAPT, web, mobile and cloud pentesting, malware analysis, forensics and SOC skills.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Do I need prior experience to join?</summary>
                    <p>No. The course starts with networking, Linux and Python basics, then moves to expert topics step by step.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Where is the cyber security course in Delhi held, and is there an online option?</summary>
                    <p>Classroom batches run at our Greater Kailash II campus in South Delhi. You can also join the online cyber security course with the same live classes, labs and mentor support.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Is this an AI cyber security course?</summary>
                    <p>Yes. Every module uses AI tools, and a dedicated Cyber Security with Gen AI module covers AI threat detection, AI phishing defence and LLM security testing.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Will I learn ethical hacking and VAPT?</summary>
                    <p>Yes. You learn the full ethical hacking syllabus plus professional VAPT with Nmap, Metasploit, Nessus and Burp Suite, and write real VAPT reports.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Are web, mobile and cloud security covered?</summary>
                    <p>Yes. There are dedicated modules for web app pentesting, Android and iOS app testing, and AWS cloud security.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Is malware analysis included?</summary>
                    <p>Yes. You study malware with static and dynamic analysis in a safe sandbox and learn basic detection.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Which certifications does it prepare me for?</summary>
                    <p>You earn the DizitalAdda Expert certificate and get exam guidance for CEH, CompTIA Security+ and OSCP.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>What is the difference between Foundation, Advanced and Expert?</summary>
                    <p>Foundation is 4 months of basics, Advanced is 6 months adding VAPT and forensics, and Expert is 12 months adding web, mobile, cloud, IoT, malware and SOC skills.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>What jobs can I get after this course?</summary>
                    <p>Penetration Tester, SOC Analyst, VAPT Analyst, Cloud Security Analyst, Malware Analyst, Mobile Security Tester and Forensics Investigator.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Do you provide placement support?</summary>
                    <p>Yes, 100% Placement Assistance: CV and portfolio review, technical mock interviews and referrals through our 250+ hiring partners.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>Is lab access provided?</summary>
                    <p>Yes. You practise in virtual labs for VAPT, web, mobile, cloud, malware and forensics throughout the course.</p>
                </details>
                            <details className="faq slide-up-section">
                    <summary>What are the batch timings?</summary>
                    <p>Weekday evening and weekend batches are available, online and in the classroom. New batches start every 2 to 3 weeks and classes are recorded.</p>
                </details>
                    </div>
    </section>


    
